units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/class2 9.0
pair_modify mix sixthpower
bond_style class2
angle_style none
dihedral_style none
improper_style none
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0 angle no dihedral no
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no

read_data system.data

pair_coeff 1 1 0.0 3.50
bond_coeff 1 1.53 250.0 -35.0 8.0

thermo_style custom step pe
run 0
